sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Server as Remote service (proposed)
    Client->>Server: create(idempotency key, policy)
    Server-->>Client: sandbox identity and lease
    Client->>Server: execute(idempotency key, request)
    Note over Client,Server: response may be lost
    Client->>Server: look up operation
    Server-->>Client: accepted, completed or unknown
